# Paired .cypher + .meta.yaml templates go here (see neo4j_client/templates.py).
#
# Empty is a valid state: TemplateLoader only warns on zero templates, it
# does not raise — but the directory itself must exist, or the conversation
# API's lifespan startup fails at `TemplateLoader()` before it ever binds a
# port. Every agent_definitions/*.yaml currently sets
# `graph.allowed_cypher_templates: []`, so nothing references a template by
# name yet; add one here (and to the relevant agent's allowlist) once a
# domain needs a graph query the safe executor can run.
